  "bio": "Sam Enriquez is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Panama City, United States, renowned for his expertise in illustrative, newschool, watercolor, and cover-up styles. With a keen eye for detail and a refined technique, Sam's work is a testament to his professionalism in the art of tattooing. His ability to bring vibrant and intricate designs to life on skin showcases his deep understanding of color and design, ensuring each piece is as unique as his clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Panama City, Florida, United States"
